  Class: 15
  Name: Stoat
  Description: Never flies straight for long. In Mass mode the triggers lay a wormhole
    dipole ahead - a sink and a source you fly through - and a thick trail behind; in
    Time mode they lay an attractor to orbit and sling off a quarter-turn round. Every
    pair that dies throws a space-time ripple that strips rivals.
